IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- The designation notifications under section 32A of the Telecommunications Act (section 37 in the 2020 Revised Edition), which name the telecommunication licensees designated for
-- Part VA of the Act (the competition provisions) and, until 21 January 2011, for subsection 10.2 of the Code of Practice for Competition in the Provision of Telecommunication Services
-- 2005 (G.N. No. S 87/2005, which is NOT deposited: the Gazette's browse page did not show it).  Seven notifications, all deposited from the e-Gazette on 2026-11-04 (each first published
-- on the day this file gives, in the "First published in the Government Gazette" line of its text):
--   S 86/2005 (Facilities-based Operator; published 18 Feb 2005, in operation 4 Mar 2005), S 233/2005 (Services-based Operator, Pacific Internet Limited; 7 Apr 2005, 7 Apr 2005),
--   S 390/2007 (Services-based Operator, Syniverse Technologies Private Limited; 20 Jul 2007 at 11:00 am, 20 Jul 2007), S 23/2011 and S 24/2011 (amend those three by deleting the words about
--   subsection 10.2; 17 Jan 2011, 21 Jan 2011), S 35/2012 (a new single Notification that cancels the first three; 31 Jan 2012, 1 Feb 2012), S 192/2012 (10 May 2012, 11 May 2012) and
--   S 521/2017 (20 Sep 2017, 22 Sep 2017), which amend S 35/2012's paragraph 2(2), the list of services-based licensees.
-- Every function takes both days, the CONDUCT day and the READING day, as sgta-i-versions.l4 does: a version counts from its effective day for conduct and from its published day for a reader.
-- A function answers NOTHING where no deposited text speaks.  Later amendments, if any, are not known to this encoding.

§ `S 86/2005: the Facilities-based Operator notification (in operation 4 March 2005)`

-- src:TA1999-DTL-S86-2005:30 | Citation and commencement
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S86-2005:31 | 1. This Notification may be cited as the Telecommunications
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S86-2005:32 | (Designated Telecommunication Licensees — Facilities-based
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S86-2005:33 | Operator) Notification 2005 and shall come into operation on
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S86-2005:34 | 4th March 2005.
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S86-2005:36 | Designated telecommunication licensees
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S86-2005:37 | 2. The Authority hereby declares all telecommunication licensees
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S86-2005:38 | granted a licence to provide facilities-based operations under
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S86-2005:39 | section 5 of the Act to be designated telecommunication licensees
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S86-2005:40 | for the purposes of Part VA of the Act and subsection 10.2 of the
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S86-2005:41 | Code of Practice for Competition in the Provision of Telecommuni-
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S86-2005:42 | cation Services 2005 (G.N. No. S 87/2005).
@ref DTL FBO Notification 2005 (src:TA1999-DTL-S86-2005:30-42)
GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`DTL S 86/2005 is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
        (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 18 2 2005)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 4 3 2005))
    AND NOT ((`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 31 1 2012)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 2 2012)))  -- cancelled by S 35/2012 paragraph 3(a)

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`DTL FBO Notification 2005 para 2: the words about subsection 10.2 of the Code of Practice for Competition are in the paragraph for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 31 1 2012)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 2 2012)) THEN NOTHING  -- the Notification is cancelled
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 17 1 2011)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 21 1 2011)) THEN JUST FALSE  -- S 23/2011
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 18 2 2005)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 4 3 2005)) THEN JUST TRUE  -- as made
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `S 233/2005: the Services-based Operator notification naming Pacific Internet Limited (in operation 7 April 2005)`

-- src:TA1999-DTL-S233-2005:29 | Citation and commencement
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S233-2005:30 | 1. This Notification may be cited as the Telecommunications
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S233-2005:31 | (Designated Telecommunication Licensees — Services-based
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S233-2005:32 | Operator) Notification 2005 and shall come into operation on 7th April
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S233-2005:33 | 2005.
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S233-2005:35 | Designated telecommunication licensees
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S233-2005:36 | 2. The Authority hereby declares Pacific Internet Limited to be
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S233-2005:37 | a designated telecommunication licensee for the purposes of Part VA
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S233-2005:38 | of the Act and subsection 10.2 of the Code of Practice for
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S233-2005:39 | Competition in the Provision of Telecommunication Services 2005
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S233-2005:40 | (G.N. No. S 87/2005).
@ref DTL SBO Notification 2005 (S 233/2005) (src:TA1999-DTL-S233-2005:29-40)
GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`DTL S 233/2005 is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
        (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 7 4 2005)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 7 4 2005))
    AND NOT ((`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 31 1 2012)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 2 2012)))  -- cancelled by S 35/2012 paragraph 3

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`DTL SBO Notification 2005 para 2: the words about subsection 10.2 of the Code of Practice for Competition are in the paragraph for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 31 1 2012)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 2 2012)) THEN NOTHING  -- the Notification is cancelled
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 17 1 2011)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 21 1 2011)) THEN JUST FALSE  -- S 24/2011
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 7 4 2005)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 7 4 2005)) THEN JUST TRUE  -- as made
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

