-- src:TA1999-DTL-S192-2012:27 | Telecommunication Licensees) Notification 2012 (G.N. No. S 35/2012)
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S192-2012:28 | is amended by deleting sub-paragraph (b) and substituting the following
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S192-2012:29 | sub-paragraphs:
