-- src:TA1999-DTL-S192-2012:31 | (c) StarHub Online Pte Ltd;
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S192-2012:32 | (d) Syniverse Technologies (Singapore) Pte Ltd.’’.
@ref DTL Notification 2012 para 2(2) as amended by S 192/2012 (src:TA1999-DTL-S192-2012:20-32)
GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`DTL S 192/2012 is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 10 5 2012)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 11 5 2012))

§ `S 521/2017: amends paragraph 2(2) of S 35/2012 (in operation 22 September 2017)`

-- src:TA1999-DTL-S521-2017:20 | Citation and commencement
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S521-2017:21 | 1. This Notification is the Telecommunications (Designated
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S521-2017:22 | Telecommunication Licensees) (Amendment) Notification 2017 and
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S521-2017:23 | comes into operation on 22 September 2017.
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S521-2017:25 | Amendment of paragraph 2
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S521-2017:26 | 2. Paragraph 2(2) of the Telecommunications (Designated
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S521-2017:27 | Telecommunication Licensees) Notification 2012 (G.N. No. S 35/2012)
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S521-2017:28 | is amended by deleting sub-paragraph (a) and substituting the
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S521-2017:29 | following sub-paragraph:
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S521-2017:30 | “(a) M1 Net Ltd;”.
-- src:TA1999-DTL-S521-2017:31 | [G.N. No. S 192/2012]
@ref DTL Notification 2012 para 2(2) as amended by S 521/2017 (src:TA1999-DTL-S521-2017:20-31)
GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`DTL S 521/2017 is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 20 9 2017)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 22 9 2017))

-- The services-based licensees declared designated by name, version by version.  S 233/2005 names Pacific Internet Limited; S 390/2007 adds Syniverse Technologies Private Limited; S 35/2012
-- paragraph 2(2) names (a) PacNet Internet (S) Pte Ltd and (b) Syniverse Technologies (Singapore) Pte Ltd; S 192/2012 deletes (b) and substitutes (b) SingNet Pte Ltd, (c) StarHub Online Pte Ltd
-- and (d) Syniverse Technologies (Singapore) Pte Ltd; S 521/2017 deletes (a) and substitutes (a) M1 Net Ltd.  From 4 March 2005 to 6 April 2005 S 86/2005 alone is in operation and names no
-- services-based licensee.  The entries are the names as the notifications print them.
GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF STRING)
`DTL: the services-based licensees declared designated by name for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 20 9 2017)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 22 9 2017)) THEN JUST (LIST "M1 Net Ltd", "SingNet Pte Ltd", "StarHub Online Pte Ltd", "Syniverse Technologies (Singapore) Pte Ltd")  -- S 521/2017
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 10 5 2012)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 11 5 2012)) THEN JUST (LIST "PacNet Internet (S) Pte Ltd", "SingNet Pte Ltd", "StarHub Online Pte Ltd", "Syniverse Technologies (Singapore) Pte Ltd")  -- S 192/2012
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 31 1 2012)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 2 2012)) THEN JUST (LIST "PacNet Internet (S) Pte Ltd", "Syniverse Technologies (Singapore) Pte Ltd")  -- S 35/2012
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 20 7 2007)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 20 7 2007)) THEN JUST (LIST "Pacific Internet Limited", "Syniverse Technologies Private Limited")  -- S 390/2007
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 7 4 2005)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 7 4 2005)) THEN JUST (LIST "Pacific Internet Limited")  -- S 233/2005
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 18 2 2005)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 4 3 2005)) THEN JUST (EMPTY)  -- S 86/2005 alone
           OTHERWISE NOTHING
